nix-instantiate (Nix) 2.35.3

### zero-dot
same            0.a
same            0.e1
same            x: x.a 0.a
both-reject     [ 0. ]
    nix: error: syntax error, unexpected ']', expecting identifier or 'or' or '${' or '"'

### float-exponent
same            1.5e
same            1.5ea
same            .5e != a
same            f 1.e

### slash-operand
same            a/(b)
same            2/(3)
same            a/"b"
same            a/[ b ]
same            c/{ }
same            r/!b

### path-double-slash
same            ./${a}//b
same            ./a/${b}//c
same            /${a}./b//c
both-reject     ./a//b
    nix: error: syntax error, unexpected end of path, expecting '${'
both-reject     ./${a}//
    nix: error: path has a trailing slash

### path-then-home
same            /${l}~/${a} or
same            ./${a}~/b
same            ~/${a}~/${b}

### not-operand
same            a + !b
same            -!a
same            a * !b
same            "" + !0
same            a + !b + c
same            -!a + b
same            a * !b ? c
same            a + !b == c

